    <record id="sales_outreach_template" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">SGC TECH AI - Sales Outreach</field>
        <field name="model">crm.lead</field>
        <field name="use_default_to" eval="True"/>
        <field name="auto_delete" eval="True"/>
        <field name="subject">Your Operational Health Score Awaits</field>
        <field name="body_html" eval="{'en_US': '&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;\n&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;title&gt;Operational Health Diagnosis — SGC TECH AI&lt;/title&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { font-family: \'Georgia\', serif; background: #FCF9F4; color: #262D41; line-height: 1.6; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }\n.header { text-align: center; padding: 30px 0; border-bottom: 3px solid #D4A042; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.logo { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #262D41; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n.tagline { font-size: 14px; color: #D4A042; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 8px; }\nh1 { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; color: #262D41; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; }\n.section { margin-bottom: 28px; padding: 20px; background: #FFF; border: 1px solid #E8E0D0; border-left: 4px solid #D4A042; }\n.section-title { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; color: #262D41; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n.section-title::before { content: \'\'; width: 4px; height: 20px; background: #D4A042; }\np { color: #4A4F5A; font-size: 15px; }\nul { padding-left: 20px; color: #4A4F5A; font-size: 15px; }\nli { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding: 25px; background: #262D41; border-radius: 4px; }\n.cta a { color: #FCF9F4; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #8A8D93; border-top: 1px solid #E8E0D0; }\n.icons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }\n.icon { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFF; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;logo&quot;&gt;SGC TECH AI&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;tagline&quot;&gt;Clarity. Control. Confidence.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;h1&gt;Your Operational Health Score Awaits&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;WHO&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;C-suite, compliance officers, and operations leaders at regulated enterprises (finance, healthcare, energy, government) running fragmented systems, manual compliance, and AI pilots without governance.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;WHAT&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A clinical diagnosis of your operational health — not a sales pitch. Our 8-dimension OHS (Operational Health Score) measures:&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Financial Controls (20%) | Process Automation (15%) | Data Integration (15%)&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Compliance Posture (10%) | Operational Efficiency (15%) | Technology Maturity (10%)&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Workforce Productivity (10%) | Scalability Readiness (5%)&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;HOW&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Three-layer treatment model — no software-only sales:&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Layer 1 — Implementation (CapEx):&lt;/strong&gt; Starter / Growth / Professional / Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Layer 2 — Platform Subscription (OpEx/mo):&lt;/strong&gt; Starter / Growth / Professional / Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Layer 3 — Operations Retainer (optional):&lt;/strong&gt; 6-month minimum&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Methodology: Patient → Symptoms → Diagnosis → Prescription → Treatment → Monitoring → Recovery&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;WHY&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You\'re not buying software. You\'re treating operational disease. Measurable OHS improvement within 90 days. 94% retention at Month 6.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diagnosis: AED 5,000 → Free.&lt;/strong&gt; No obligation. Full 8-dimension OHS report with clinical findings and prescribed treatment path.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;cta&quot;&gt;\n&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:hello@sgctech.ai&quot;&gt;Claim Your Free Diagnosis →&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;footer&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;SGC TECH AI | sgctech.ai | hello@sgctech.ai&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icons&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#0A66C2&quot;&gt;in&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#000&quot;&gt;X&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#C43A8E&quot;&gt;📷&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#FF0000&quot;&gt;▶&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#1877F2&quot;&gt;f&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#000&quot;&gt;♪&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;'}"/>
    </record>

    <!-- ============================================================
         SGC TECH AI - Research Participation Email Template
         Sent from stage "Research Done" (stage_id=2)
         ============================================================ -->
    <record id="research_done_template" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">SGC TECH AI - Research Participation</field>
        <field name="model">crm.lead</field>
        <field name="use_default_to" eval="True"/>
        <field name="auto_delete" eval="True"/>
        <field name="subject">UAE AI &amp; Tech Adoption Index 2026</field>
        <field name="body_html" eval="{'en_US': '&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;\n&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;title&gt;UAE AI &amp; Tech Adoption Index 2026 — SGC TECH AI Research&lt;/title&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { font-family: \'Georgia\', serif; background: #FCF9F4; color: #262D41; line-height: 1.6; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }\n.header { text-align: center; padding: 30px 0; border-bottom: 3px solid #D4A042; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.logo { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #262D41; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n.tagline { font-size: 14px; color: #D4A042; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 8px; }\nh1 { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; color: #262D41; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; }\n.section { margin-bottom: 28px; padding: 20px; background: #FFF; border: 1px solid #E8E0D0; border-left: 4px solid #D4A042; }\n.section-title { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; color: #262D41; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n.section-title::before { content: \'\'; width: 4px; height: 20px; background: #D4A042; }\np { color: #4A4F5A; font-size: 15px; }\nul { padding-left: 20px; color: #4A4F5A; font-size: 15px; }\nli { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding: 25px; background: #262D41; border-radius: 4px; }\n.cta a { color: #FCF9F4; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #8A8D93; border-top: 1px solid #E8E0D0; }\n.icons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }\n.icon { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFF; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;logo&quot;&gt;SGC TECH AI&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;tagline&quot;&gt;Clarity. Control. Confidence.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;h1&gt;UAE AI &amp; Tech Adoption Index 2026&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;WHAT&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The first independent, operator-level study measuring AI implementation — not announcements — across 14 UAE sectors. 300+ structured interviews with CFOs, COOs, CTOs tracking procurement, deployment, retraining, governance, and unit-economics impact.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;WHY&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&quot;We bought the software. We never bought the change.&quot; — CFO, Dubai Logistics Group (AED 180M revenue). 0% of 2025 GenAI pilots are in production with measurable P&amp;L impact. The bottleneck isn\'t model access — it\'s operational fluency.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;HOW&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sampling:&lt;/strong&gt; Stratified across 14 priority sectors (UAE AI Strategy 2031 + top-employment verticals), 3 operator tiers&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instrument:&lt;/strong&gt; 12-minute structured interviews; procurement → deployment → retraining → governance → unit economics&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fieldwork:&lt;/strong&gt; Opened June 2026; mid-field checkpoint → analysis &amp; audit → public release&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit:&lt;/strong&gt; Full instrument, sampling frame, and coding rubric released with Index for independent interrogation&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;WHO&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Led by &lt;strong&gt;Brandon Greaves&lt;/strong&gt;, Principal Investigator &amp; Founder, SGC TECH AI. Small, named research team — every finding has a person behind it. Partners include: Ministry of AI, DIFC Innovation Hub, Hub71, Mohammed bin Rashid AI Lab, G42 Research, Khalifa University.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;PARTICIPATE&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;12 minutes. Embargoed access to the full Index. Confidential, calendar-friendly interviews. Participants receive the full report — including their sector cut — under a one-week embargo before public release.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;cta&quot;&gt;\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://research.sgctech.ai&quot;&gt;Request to Participate →&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;footer&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;SGC TECH AI | research.sgctech.ai | research@sgctech.ai&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icons&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#0A66C2&quot;&gt;in&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#000&quot;&gt;X&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#C43A8E&quot;&gt;📷&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#FF0000&quot;&gt;▶&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#1877F2&quot;&gt;f&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; style=&quot;background:#000&quot;&gt;♪&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;'}"/>
    </record>
</odoo>
